e midterms is committing from day 1 to real mass deportations and using the military to facilitate that. I'm talking tanks rolling down the street and soldiers checking ID on every corner for 4 straight years until all 100m were deported. Bovino would have made the perfect Secretary of Homeland Security.\r\n\r\nOR we could have just delivered the lower energy prices, lower cost of living and no new wars that the campaign promised.\r\n\r\nEither of those options (or both) would have won the midterms easily..but instead we got...Susie Wiles.\r\n\r\nHope I'm wrong!", "author": "JoePlumber", "created": 1789132957746, "profile_picture": "WZEHyEIDoCvf", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Secondrun007", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "This Susie Wiles presidency is going to lose us the midterms. ", "last_comment_created": 1789151824630, "content": "<p>I'll still be in line in November to vote straight ticket GOP. But I can see the writing on the wall. Even with the SCOTUS ruling and redistricting wins we are going to lose anyway.</p>\n<p>What would have won the midterms is committing from day 1 to real mass deportations and using the military to facilitate that. I'm talking tanks rolling down the street and soldiers checking ID on every corner for 4 straight years until all 100m were deported. Bovino would have made the perfect Secretary of Homeland Security.</p>\n<p>OR we could have just delivered the lower energy prices, lower cost of living and no new wars that the campaign promised.</p>\n<p>Either of those options (or both) would have won the midterms easily..but instead we got...Susie Wiles.</p>\n<p>Hope I'm wrong!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": fal